<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:20:06 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Eyes Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Jump: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>2026 年黑色星期五：购物者试图减少开支，寻找优惠</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/black-friday-2026-shoppers-cut-back-hunt-for-deals-video</link><description>由于谨慎的购物者提早囤积必需品并倾向于打折促销，预计 2026 年黑色星期五的支出将会增加。彭博社的安妮·邦报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/black-friday-2026-shoppers-cut-back-hunt-for-deals-video'&gt;2026 年黑色星期五：购物者试图减少开支，寻找优惠&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Black Friday 2026: Shoppers Try to Cut Back, Hunt for Deals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/black-friday-2026-shoppers-cut-back-hunt-for-deals-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:02:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Fall as Haven Demand Ebbs Amid Stocks Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</link><description>Anthropic PBC 的股价攀升至 83 美元以上的首次公开募股价格之上，这家人工智能实验室希望以积极的表现结束创纪录的首次亮相后在纳斯达克的首个日历周。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo'&gt;首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Jump After Volatile First Week Since IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:49:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</link><description>一项可能重塑全球烟草业的三方协议也可能波及另一个其产品有时与香烟一起消费的行业——啤酒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake'&gt;奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria’s Interest in Imperial May Affect Its AB InBev Stake&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>